<Method Name="SequenceAbortRejectsInvalidIdentity" Id="{09a36863-eb04-424e-ba7c-7650cc30ea99}"><Declaration><![CDATA[METHOD SequenceAbortRejectsInvalidIdentity]]></Declaration><Implementation><ST><![CDATA[TEST('SequenceAbortRejectsInvalidIdentity');
