<Method Name="SequenceResetRejectsInvalidIdentity" Id="{a7f1f748-8b72-4fa5-8d32-af8754721a5c}"><Declaration><![CDATA[METHOD SequenceResetRejectsInvalidIdentity]]></Declaration><Implementation><ST><![CDATA[TEST('SequenceResetRejectsInvalidIdentity');
