<Method Name="ActuatorResetRejectsInvalidIdentity" Id="{3eeee90a-2951-4718-bd16-4b2347ccb230}"><Declaration><![CDATA[METHOD ActuatorResetRejectsInvalidIdentity]]></Declaration><Implementation><ST><![CDATA[TEST('ActuatorResetRejectsInvalidIdentity');
device11(inRetracted := TRUE); device11.Advance(); device11();
rsp := device11.Reset(eRequester := invalid^);
